window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Seven months after the events of Pack's Queen, Red and her mates are finally able to enjoy their bond. With the imminent arrival of their babies, their only concern is how many diapers to buy and picking out babies' names.</p> <p>But the Furies, Artemis' ancient enemies, have escaped their Underworld prison, and they're now thirsty for revenge. Unable to touch the goddess, they have set their sight on Artemis' former wolves, Sam and Dante.</p> <p>Fearsome and powerful, their malicious spell will not only affect the Wolfe brothers but everyone in Crimson Hollow.</p> <p>To save her mates, Red will have to rely on her instincts and on the power of the bond she shares with Tristan, Sam, and Dante. But time is not on her side. If she can't destroy the Furies and reverse their spell, she might lose everything she loves, including her unborn children.</p> <p><b>Contains mature themes.</b></p>"; 
